<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</link><description>银行正在向 CVC Capital Partners Plc 提供高达 110 亿欧元（合 120 亿美元）的债务融资，用于收购 Verisure Plc，因为这家收购公司在经历了公开市场艰难的一年后，正在考虑将家庭安全集团重新归私人所有。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover'&gt;银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Banks Pitch CVC €11 Billion Debt for Possible Verisure Deal&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:07:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>10 月份核心 PCE 势头依然强劲</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video</link><description>美国消费者支出在今年早些时候激增后，于 10 月份陷入停滞，这表明家庭在进入假期季节时稍作喘息。根据周三公布的经济分析局数据，经通胀调整后的个人支出与一个月前相比几乎没有变化。加拿大皇家银行美国高级经济学家迈克·里德对通胀数据做出反应。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video'&gt;10 月份核心 PCE 势头依然强劲&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Core PCE Momentum Remained Elevated in October&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/core-pce-momentum-remained-elevated-in-october-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:19:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps Below $3,500 on Rate Hike Outlook, AI Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Tumbles in ‘Sell First’ Mode as AI Angst Fuels Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</link><description>铜、铝和锡都加剧了周二金属的大幅抛售，因为科技股扩大了跌幅，交易员们为美国通胀数据做好准备，这些数据将为美联储下一步的利率举措提供依据。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation'&gt;人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Heads Toward Bear-Market Territory as Selloff Continues&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:57:12 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>